      "statement": "After schema execution, initializeDatabase() calls runMigrations(db) to apply the full additive migration chain (phase table creation, MCP server/default-policy seeding, multi-tenancy migration, frontier-expert taxonomy seeding, performance indexes), then ensureDatabaseInstanceId(db) to guarantee a persistent database identity, and if a restore was applied earlier in the same boot, records a best-effort BACKUP_RESTORE_COMPLETED audit event attributing the restore to the actor recorded in the marker.",
      "evidence": [
