      "id": "claim_61dcdb02efb34bcf85d8381a55fa0291",
      "statement": "audit_events (and the compliance_audit_log view over it) are hash-chained (previous_hash, hash, chain_sequence columns) and enforced append-only at the SQLite level: BEFORE UPDATE/BEFORE DELETE triggers on audit_events, and INSTEAD OF UPDATE/DELETE triggers on the compliance_audit_log view, both call RAISE(FAIL, ...) so any UPDATE or DELETE against either fails regardless of the calling code path; compliance_audit_log writes are redirected into audit_events via an INSTEAD OF INSERT trigger.",
