      "statement": "BackupService.createBackup() produces a backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.tar.gz archive containing exactly manifest.json, djimitflo.sqlite, and checksums.sha256; the SQLite snapshot is produced via better-sqlite3's native db.backup(), which is safe to run against a live database under concurrent writes, and the manifest records per-table row counts, databaseSha256, appVersion, and fixed confidentiality warnings about password hashes/governance evidence, excluded secrets, and excluded repository working trees.",
